/// Checks whether a list is monotonic.
///
/// A list is considered monotonic if it is entirely non-decreasing,
/// entirely non-increasing, or has only one element.
///
/// If the input list is `null` or empty, this function returns `true`.
///
/// Examples:
/// ```dart
